From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: macbox <macbox@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:43:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 51/92] live surface_twin_reader_first: a lazy surface's reader
 made first is its first shadow

A reader (ShaderRead only) made before its surface's writer stayed an image in place over the
pages, and the writer's shadow beside it brought its bytes back every frame (about one copy back
per Sim frame under Coherent). With the switch on (default off) such a reader becomes the
surface's first lazy shadow, planned with RenderTarget | ShaderRead, so the writer made after
it binds it through surface_twin. Counted as readers-first in the surface_lazy report.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
